      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cullom%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village sprang up when the Illinois Central Railroad reached the area in 1878, making it a rail town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cullom%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first post office opened in 1878, with John Weinland as its inaugural postmaster.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
