      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cullom%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cullom’s early economy boasted a diverse mix of shops, including a drug store, a milliner shop, and a cobbler, reflecting a bustling 19th‑century rural hub.",
